{"repositoryId":1389461711,"availability":"available","full":"OstinUA/slack-app-manifest-generator","name":"slack-app-manifest-generator","description":"🤖 Visual builder for Slack app manifest YAML. Generate schema-compliant manifests in seconds — OAuth scopes, slash commands, event subscriptions, shortcuts, interactivity, Socket Mode — with live preview, validation, import, copy and download. Free, client-side, no signup.","category":"Design","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-26T15:52:44Z","updated":"2026-09-26T16:33:56Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ostinua.github.io/slack-app-manifest-generator/","topics":["automation","chatbot","code-generator","contributions-welcome","developer-tools","github-pages","hacktoberfest","html","javascript","no-code","oauth","open-source","slack","slack-api","slack-app","slack-bot","slash-commands","tailwindcss","webapp","yaml"],"demo":"https://ostinua.github.io/slack-app-manifest-generator/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T19:33:54.154Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T19:33:54.154Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T19:33:54.154Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T19:33:54.154Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Build a schema-compliant Slack app manifest — live, offline, and entirely in your browser.","A single-file, zero-build, zero-backend tool that turns a guided form (app metadata, OAuth scopes, slash commands, event subscriptions, shortcuts, interactivity) into a validated, syntax-highlighted manifest.yaml in real time — plus round-trip import of existing manifests and durable workspace persistence.","Positioning. The upstream brief for this document was \"a README for a logging library\"; the artifact in this repository is the opposite end of the observability pipeline — a manifest generator that produces the declarative configuration of a Slack app. The two converge in practice: the generated manifest.yaml is the versioned, reviewable source of truth you commit next to your chat-ops and log-delivery code, so incident tooling, alert routing, and Slack app capabilities can never drift apart. Everything documented below is derived strictly from the shipped source code."],"features":["Seven-section guided form mapping 1:1 onto the Slack manifest schema: Basic Information (name, short/long description, background color), Features & Settings (6 toggles), OAuth Scopes, Slash Commands, Event…","Real-time YAML output rendered on every keystroke — no \"Generate\" button, no submit round-trip, no page reloads.","Live character counters on appName (35-char Slack limit) and shortDescription (140-char Slack limit), enforced both by maxlength and by the visible n / limit counter.","Synchronised color input — a native picker and a free-text hex field stay in lockstep; the picker normalises to upper-case hex, and valid hex typed into the text field is pushed back into the picker.","Dynamic repeaters for slash commands and shortcuts with per-row Add / Remove controls and stable data- field binding."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/OstinUA/slack-app-manifest-generator/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"8404e0554b5c9329b8cc7aa5246d5bd8e0ce0337ad8e3e7ae6ac1b7474eb9f49","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T19:33:54.298Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T19:33:54.298Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Build a schema-compliant Slack app manifest — live, offline, and entirely in your browser.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/OstinUA/slack-app-manifest-generator/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"8404e0554b5c9329b8cc7aa5246d5bd8e0ce0337ad8e3e7ae6ac1b7474eb9f49","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/OstinUA/slack-app-manifest-generator/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T19:33:54.299Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-26T16:33:56Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/OstinUA/slack-app-manifest-